    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰλᾰγ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>babble</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.97
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ λαλάγει τὰ τοιαῦτ</span>'
				ib.<i><span class="en">
